  "limitations": [
    "Role-manager selection qualifies actual HOME/Dialer/SMS integration in an isolated CI emulator; physical chooser consent/denial and OEM behavior remain separate qualification.",
    "Incoming emulator SMS and Telecom call are real Android integration, but do not establish outgoing SMS/MMS physical carrier delivery, SIM/RF interoperability, RCS or emergency-call behavior.",
    "The app Answer button is actually tapped; teardown is driven by remote-end simulation via emulator gsm cancel, not an End-call tap.",
    "13 native MMS codec assertions exercise encoding/parsing/bounds with zero RF requests; no carrier MMS transport is claimed.",
    "NotificationListener grant/admission/render/revoke/exact restoration are verified through scoped commands in a private emulator. Physical user consent, OEM revocation/background policy and hardware-specific behavior remain device qualification. A separate notification regrant phase was not run."
  ],
